---
const lastUpdated = "September 2026";
---

<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <title>Privacy Notice — prodbytes.com</title>
  </head>
  <body>
    <a class="back-link" href="/">&larr; Back to all graphics</a>

    <main class="content">
      <h1>Privacy Notice</h1>
      <p class="updated">Last updated: {lastUpdated}</p>

      <p>
        Prodbytes ("we," "us," "the site") provides free downloadable
        graphics. This notice explains what information we collect when
        you use the site and how it's used.
      </p>

      <h2>What we collect</h2>
      <p>
        The only personal information we collect is your <strong>email
        address</strong>, which you provide when you choose to download a
        graphic. We don't collect names, payment information, or any
        other personal details.
      </p>

      <h2>How we use your email</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>To let you download graphics without re-entering your email every time (via a browser cookie)</li>
        <li>To send you occasional updates about new graphics, using Kit, our email service provider</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Cookies</h2>
      <p>
        When you enter your email, we set a cookie in your browser so you
        won't be asked again on future visits. This cookie doesn't track
        you across other websites and contains no personal information
        itself — just a signed token confirming you've previously signed up.
      </p>

      <h2>Third parties</h2>
      <p>We use the following services to run this site:</p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Cloudflare</strong> — hosting, file storage, and our database</li>
        <li><strong>Kit</strong> — email delivery and list management</li>
      </ul>
      <p>
        Your email is shared with Kit solely to manage our mailing list.
        We do not sell, rent, or share your email with any other third
        party for any purpose.
      </p>

      <h2>Unsubscribing</h2>
      <p>
        Every email we send includes an unsubscribe link. You can opt out
        of future emails at any time — this won't affect your ability to
        continue downloading graphics from the site.
      </p>

      <h2>Download tracking</h2>
      <p>
        We keep an internal record of which graphics are downloaded (not
        tied to your email) to understand which graphics are popular.
        This data is anonymous and used only for our own site analytics.
      </p>

      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>
        Questions about this notice or your data? Reach out at
        <a href="mailto:hello@timdwyer.co"> hello@timdwyer.co</a>.
      </p>

      <h2>Changes to this notice</h2>
      <p>
        If this notice changes, we'll update the date at the top of this
        page.
      </p>
    </main>

    <style>
      body {
        font-family: system-ui, sans-serif;
        margin: 0;
        color: #1a1a1a;
      }
      .back-link {
        display: inline-block;
        padding: 1.25rem 1.5rem 0;
        color: #444;
        text-decoration: none;
        font-size: 0.9rem;
      }
      .content {
        max-width: 640px;
        margin: 0 auto;
        padding: 1.5rem 1.5rem 4rem;
        line-height: 1.6;
      }
      .updated {
        color: #777;
        font-size: 0.85rem;
        margin-top: -0.5rem;
      }
      h2 {
        margin-top: 2rem;
        font-size: 1.15rem;
      }
      a {
        color: #1a1a1a;
      }
    </style>
  </body>
</html>
